  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 296934,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/art-ix/picturesharp.jxl",
  "published": "2026-10-28T19:15:35.53Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.7.9: faster lossy (VarDCT) encoding: chroma-from-luma and AC strategy searches without hard-to-predict branches, 8-point DCT leaves without copy passes, encoding from the image buffer without a pixel copy, and a correctly rounded cube root for the XYB conversion (port of CORE-MATH cbrtf, MIT). 1 MP lossy encode about 1.2x faster at efforts 1, 3 and 7, 8-bit and 16-bit. Lossless encoding, decoding and JPEG transcoding are byte-identical to 0.7.8; some lossy files differ in a few bytes (same size and quality).",
